Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.10.107-rt122 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.10.107 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.10-rt
  Head SHA1: 2391e2bc288ee59e34e4e0eb695b86a89a228445


Or to build 3.10.107-rt122 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.10.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.10.107.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.10/patch-3.10.107-rt122.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
